        {
          "sourceId": "src-4af9ae6784e45a88",
          "quote": "The Bennett Lab studies the fundamental principles of how cells build, maintain, and destroy proteins . Our research aims to define mechanisms that can be leveraged to promote healthy aging and combat human aging-associated disorders.",
