        },
        {
          "sourceId": "src-4af9ae6784e45a88",
          "quote": "The research group utilizes integrated molecular, genetic, and systems-level approaches to examine mechanisms that catalyze proteome remodeling. We employ global and quantitative proteomic platforms that enable systematic analyses of protein homeostasis. These platforms enable studies aimed at detailing how the proteome responds to both genetic and environmental challenges to proteostasis.",
