        },
        {
          "sourceId": "src-fa7a184d7a0cf5d4",
          "quote": "For neuronal networks, we are using optical imaging of whole nervous systems in small jellyfish medusa, and for gene networks we are analyzing whole-genome scale expression patterns in response to manipulations in Paramecium and cyanobacteria.",
