        },
        {
          "sourceId": "src-f79eb7d2691acb9e",
          "quote": "Investigation of the development of neuronal excitability led to the discovery that calcium-dependent embryonic electrical activity rapidly and reversibly reconfigures the transmitters and matching postsynaptic transmitter receptors that neurons express.",
