        },
        {
          "sourceId": "src-f79eb7d2691acb9e",
          "quote": "The changes in brain biochemistry during transmitter switching cause changes in behavior that can be beneficial, enhancing learning, or detrimental, contributing to neurological and psychiatric disorders.",
